  "@type": "schema:Dataset",
  "schema:name": "Unit API JSON-LD context",
  "schema:description": "A JSON-LD @context for the objects Unit's own API contract declares: one class per component schema, one property per declared field, typed from the contract. Derived by script (derive-json-ld.py, 2026-10-12) from openapi/unit-co-accounts-api-openapi.yml, openapi/unit-co-api-tokens-api-openapi.yml, openapi/unit-co-applications-api-openapi.yml.",
